---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="How applying works — SRM Compass"
  description="Three clear, verified steps to navigate the SRM admissions process with official portal links."
>
  <section class="blk">
    <div class="w">
      <h1>How applying works</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        A direct guide to the official SRM B.Tech application procedure, eliminating redundant forms and broken subdomain links.
      </p>

      <ol class="st">
        <li>
          Check the official 2026-27 eligibility criteria on{' '}
          <a
            href="https://www.srmist.edu.in/admission-india/engineering/"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank"
          >
            SRM’s engineering admissions page
          </a>
          .
        </li>
        <li>
          Apply once on{' '}
          <a
            href="https://applications.srmist.edu.in/btech"
            rel="noopener"
            target="_blank"
          >
            SRM’s official B.Tech application form
          </a>
          .
        </li>
        <li>
          Choose your campus, programme and specialisation at counselling. The form says your preference is collected for statistics only.
        </li>
      </ol>

      <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        <a class="btn p" href="/#programmes">See programmes</a>
        <a class="btn s" href="/eligibility">View eligibility rules</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
